WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,330
Where is Shen Xi? Where is her mother?

2
00:00:02,330 --> 00:00:06,300
Zero spring water might be able to help her mother relieve her condition.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,860
Zero spring cannot be exposed

4
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:09,940
Let’s just say it’s a medicinal spring in the mountains.

5
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,820
Lao Lie people say it can moisten the lungs and relieve coughs.

6
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:21,000
This thing needs to be returned to her

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,960
Let her take it back to her brother to eat

8
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:28,480
Who is it?

9
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,880
Chen Xi, it’s me, Qin Tian

10
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:35,150
Come in quickly, don't let anyone see you

11
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:40,070
Let me see Shen Zi

12
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:41,788
No

13
00:00:41,788 --> 00:00:48,660
You already live in a cave yourself

14
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:50,310
Take it back

15
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:55,510
Child, you just separated

16
00:00:55,510 --> 00:00:56,830
More difficult than us

17
00:00:56,830 --> 00:00:58,230
Take it back
